### cadastrar funcionario
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Paula",
    "email": "paula@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc"
}


### cadastrar cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Paula",
    "cpf": "12345678912"
}


### consultar cliente
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1


### apagar cliente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/1

### atualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:3000/cliente/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "codCliente": 3,
    "nome": "a",
    "cpf": "12345678912"
}


### cadastrar equipamento
POST http://localhost:3000/equipamento
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "modelo": "A0",
    "fabricante": "Media",
    "numSerie": "985384923sd",
    "idCliente": 3
}


### cadastrar inspecao
POST http://localhost:3000/inspecao
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "PENDENTE",
    "data": "2026-08-29",
    "idEquipamento": 3
}